[16.855,"o","Yes. Inline projects in `test.projects` don't inherit anything from your root config by default.\r\n"]
[17.105,"o","Each one is treated as a standalone config unless you add `extends: true`, which merges the root\r\n"]
[17.355,"o","config's options (plugins, `test` settings like `setupFiles` and `environment`, and so on) into that\r\n"]
[17.605,"o","project.\r\n"]
[17.855,"o","\r\n"]
[18.105,"o","The exception is root-only options like `reporters` and `coverage`, which apply to the whole run\r\n"]
[18.355,"o","whether or not you set `extends`. If you'd rather not repeat the flag, you can put the shared\r\n"]
[18.605,"o","settings in a common config and pull them into each project with `mergeConfig`, or point `extends`\r\n"]
[18.855,"o","at a shared config file path.\r\n"]
[20.605,"o","\u001b[2m# Wrong for vitest 5: inline projects inherit the root config by default. Code written the vitest 4\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.655,"o","\u001b[2m# way still runs, without an error.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
