[60.005,"o","vitest >=4.0.0 changed what `vi.restoreAllMocks` does. vi.restoreAllMocks no longer resets the state\r\n"]
[60.285,"o","of spies and only restores spies created manually with vi.spyOn. Silent: code written for older\r\n"]
[60.565,"o","versions still runs, without an error.\r\n"]
